msgid "Host mode disconnects USB networking and serial on this port. F50 has no battery; management may be lost and a USB adapter usually needs a powered hub."
msgstr "Mode host memutus jaringan USB dan serial pada port ini. F50 tidak memiliki baterai; akses manajemen bisa hilang dan adaptor USB biasanya memerlukan hub berdaya."

